    "slug": "jovo-jovi/tinytasks",
    "owner": "jovo-jovi",
    "brief": "TinyTasks is a minimal, responsive task-tracking web application that lets users create, edit, delete, prioritize, and manage tasks through Todo, In Progress, and Done statuses. It includes status filters, task counts, form validation, and clear loading, empty, and error states. The goal is to validate the DEV_OS development workflow end to end with a small, production-quality application, including UI/UX design, implementation, automated testing, GitHub integration, deployment, and verification. Keep the architecture simple, avoid unnecessary dependencies and features, and document setup and acceptance criteria.",
    "audience": "An individual developer who wants a simple, reliable way to organize daily tasks and validate a development workflow.",
